    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/vienna-road-signs#AdditionalPanel"/>
    <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://example.org/vienna-road-signs#modifiesSign"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Relates a main road sign to an additional panel that qualifies or modifies its meaning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>Property characteristic added: this property is asymmetric and irreflexive because it is the inverse directional relation from a main road sign to its modifying additional panel and cannot relate a sign to itself.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
